      "content": "Thanks. It's a good start, but it feels a little bit \"template-y.\" I'm worried it's a bit too dry. \n\nSince the sentiment score is looking a little low on my end with that draft, maybe we can brighten it up a bit? I know I said not to game it, but we really want the customer to feel like we are genuinely happy to help and that we are a warm, welcoming brand. \n\nCan you try another version? Try to make it feel more positive and welcoming while still being an apology. Just don't make it sound like a greeting card, okay? We still need to actually address the cold food issue.",
